# FORCED Session Memory (non-negotiable)

Full protocol: **`SESSION_MEMORY.md`**. You MUST follow it. Chat does not survive session switches.

## FORCED on session start — before any tool call

Read in order: `AGENT_HANDOFF.md` → `ONBOARDING.md` → `AGENTS.md` → active `.claude/plans/*.md` if relevant.

## FORCED before saying DONE or ending a substantive turn

1. **Update `AGENT_HANDOFF.md`** — HEAD sha, shipped, in-flight, open/next, blocked, gotchas
2. **Promote durable facts** to `ONBOARDING.md` or the active plan file
3. **Never** leave task state only in chat

**You are NOT allowed to mark a task complete without updating the repo docs.** Exception: pure Q&A with zero new facts and zero code changes.

## Sub-agents

Every `Agent` / workflow prompt MUST include the §4 contract from `SESSION_MEMORY.md` and require handoff updates before reporting done.

## Self-check (mandatory)

Before your final message on substantive work: "Would a brand-new session reading only repo docs know what to do next?" If no → write docs first.
